"Volume %(volume_id)s did not finish being created even after we waited "
"%(seconds)s seconds or %(attempts)s attempts. And its status is "
"%(volume_status)s."
msgstr ""
"Volume %(volume_id)s het nie klaar geskep nie, selfs nadat ons gewag het "
