#, python-format
msgid ""
"This service is older (v%(thisver)i) than the minimum (v%(minver)i) version "
"of the rest of the deployment. Unable to continue."
msgstr ""
"Hierdie diens is ouer (v%(thisver)i) dan die minimum (v%(minver)i) weergawe "
"van die res van die ontplooiing. Nie in staat voortgaan nie."

