#, python-format
msgid ""
"The supplied disk path (%(path)s) already exists, it is expected not to "
"exist."
msgstr ""
"Die voorsiende skyfpad (%(path)s) reeds bestaan, dit word verwag om nie te "
"bestaan nie."

